# Copy this file to .env. Docker Compose and the Makefile load it
# automatically. Keep real secrets in .env; that file is git-ignored.

# ── Required: complete DvTP + EUDI demo ───────────────────────────────
# These five values are required by `make demo-full`.

# Public HTTPS URL where the wallet reaches the issuance-server.
# Its hostname is used as the OpenID4VP client_id and must be present in
# every reader certificate as a DNS SAN.
EUDI_PUBLIC_URL=https://eudi-is.yourdomain.tld/

# Public HTTPS URL where the issuance-server reaches the eudi-adapter.
EUDI_BRI_URL=https://eudi-bri.yourdomain.tld/
# Password for the local issuance-server Postgres database. Any non-empty
# random value is sufficient for the local demo network.
EUDI_POSTGRES_PASSWORD=

# FSC Peer ID written to dienstverlener_oin by the predefined DvTP issuance
# scenarios in the developer portal. Leave unset for the local demo default
# (99999999900000000300); deployments must set their actual consumer Peer ID.
# DVTP_CONSUMER_PEER_ID=0000009950HYPBV00000

# Dedicated Source Release Registry roles in the same physical PostgreSQL
# cluster. The adapter and issuance materializer use the read-only password.
SOURCE_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=
SOURCE_REGISTRY_READER_PASSWORD=

# Required only when using the bundled Cloudflare connector:
#   COMPOSE_FILE=docker-compose.yml:docker-compose.cloudflare-tunnel.yml make demo-full
# Obtain the token from Cloudflare Zero Trust -> Networks -> Tunnels.
# CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN=eyJ...your-token-here...

# Cloudflare Public Hostname routes:
#   EUDI_PUBLIC_URL host -> http://eudi-issuance-server:18001
#   EUDI_BRI_URL host    -> http://eudi-adapter:4009
# Add a final hostname-wide Cache Rule with "Bypass cache" for the complete
# EUDI_PUBLIC_URL host and purge that hostname once. Issuer metadata and
# request_uri responses are dynamic and must never be cached.

# ── Issuance-server and wallet (optional) ─────────────────────────────
# The server defaults to the pinned v0.5.0 submodule. Override only when
# deliberately testing another matching nl-wallet checkout.
# NLWALLET_PATH=/absolute/path/to/your/nl-wallet-repo

# Universal-link base used by the landing page and developer portal.
# The default below normally does not need to be overridden.
# EUDI_UL_BASE=https://app.preproductie.wallet.edi.bzk.nl/deeplink/disclosure_based_issuance

# Issuer, reader and status certificate references are not environment
# variables. Source Releases store only the public certificate identity and
# digest; the issuance materializer resolves keys from the mounted Secret. For local use,
# `make demo-full` explicitly provisions source-bound development leaves.
# Production uses certificate material from an authorized management process.
# ONBOARDING_PUBLIC_CERTIFICATES_DIR=/absolute/path/to/public-only-certificates

# ── FSC infrastructure and isolated worktrees (optional) ─────────────
# `make` creates fsc-infra/.env with FSC_POSTGRES_PASSWORD when it is absent.
# Keep FSC database/project/port overrides in fsc-infra/.env.
#
# Set this root variable only when the main stack must join an FSC Compose
# project with a non-default name, for example a second worktree.
# FSC_INFRA_NETWORK=my-worktree-fsc_default

# ── Logboek Dataverwerkingen (optional) ───────────────────────────────
# The bearer token the components use to write to their Verantwoordelijke's
# logbook, and the keys from which a logbook-local subject pseudonym is
# derived where a component holds only a BSN. All fall back to local-demo
# values; set them in any deployment. The token is the whole access model on
# the write endpoint, so treat it as a secret.
#
# The pseudonym key is per Verantwoordelijke on purpose: a shared key would
# make the same citizen recognisable across organisations' logbooks, which is
# exactly what a logbook-local pseudonym must not do.
# LDV_WRITE_TOKEN=
# LDV_SUBJECT_PSEUDONYM_KEY=
# LDV_SUBJECT_PSEUDONYM_KEY_BRP=
# LDV_SUBJECT_PSEUDONYM_KEY_GBO=

# ── OpenFTV Manager profile (required only for `make demo-manager`) ────
# These values are not used by `make demo-full`.
# KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
# FTV_MANAGER_AUDITOR_PASSWORD=
# FTV_MANAGER_DEPLOY_PASSWORD=
# FTV_POSTGRES_PASSWORD=

# Browser-reachable HTTPS URLs for a remotely deployed Manager UI and IdP.
# Localhost defaults are used when these remain unset.
# GBO_FTV_MANAGER_URL=https://gbo-ftv-api.example.org
# GBO_FTV_OIDC_AUTHORITY=https://gbo-ftv-auth.example.org/realms/gbo

# ── Browser-facing links (optional) ───────────────────────────────────
# Hostname used for locally published UI, observability and FSC links.
# Set a LAN address when the browser runs on another machine.
# GBO_PUBLIC_HOST=localhost

# Override FSC Controller links shown on the landing page. Their defaults are
# http://<GBO_PUBLIC_HOST>:8092, :8096 and :8094 respectively.
# FSC_CONTROLLER_BRON_URL=http://localhost:8092
# FSC_CONTROLLER_DVTP_URL=http://localhost:8096
# FSC_CONTROLLER_EUDI_URL=http://localhost:8094

# Optional text shown in the landing-page footer.
# VERSION_STRING=

# ── Published host ports: observability (optional) ────────────────────
# Override ports to run multiple worktrees side by side.
# GBO_PORT_OTEL_GRPC=9317
# GBO_PORT_OTEL_HTTP=9318
# GBO_PORT_JAEGER=9686
# GBO_PORT_LOKI=9310
# GBO_PORT_GRAFANA=9300

# ── Published host ports: GBO services (optional) ─────────────────────
# GBO_PORT_OPA=9181
# GBO_PORT_OPA_HEALTH=9180
# GBO_PORT_GRAPHQL=9400
# GBO_PORT_BRP_GRAPHQL=9401
# GBO_PORT_CONSENT_REGISTER=9402
# GBO_PORT_BSNK=9403
# GBO_PORT_SECTOR_PIP=9404
# GBO_PORT_CONSENT_PORTAL_BACKEND=9405
# GBO_PORT_DV_BACKEND=9406
# GBO_PORT_DEV_PORTAL_BACKEND=9407
# GBO_PORT_EUDI_ADAPTER=9409
# GBO_PORT_BRON_SIDECAR=9411
# GBO_PORT_BRP_SIDECAR=9413
# GBO_PORT_DVTP_ONBOARDING_REGISTER=9415
# GBO_PORT_LOGBOEK_BD=9416
# GBO_PORT_LOGBOEK_BRP=9417
# GBO_PORT_LOGBOEK_GBO=9418
# GBO_PORT_EUDI_ISSUANCE=18001

# ── Published host ports: frontends (optional) ────────────────────────
# Keep GBO_PORT_TOESTEMMINGSPORTAAL exactly one above GBO_PORT_DV_MOCK;
# the consent redirect derives one from the other.
# GBO_PORT_LANDING=9000
# GBO_PORT_DV_MOCK=9001
# GBO_PORT_TOESTEMMINGSPORTAAL=9002
# GBO_PORT_DEVELOPER_PORTAL=9003

# ── Published host ports: OpenFTV Manager (optional) ──────────────────
# GBO_PORT_FTV_MANAGER=9280
# GBO_PORT_FTV_MANAGER_INTERNAL=9281
# GBO_PORT_FTV_MANAGER_HEALTH=9282
# GBO_PORT_FTV_MANAGER_UI=9283
# GBO_PORT_KEYCLOAK=9284
